1. Data Structure: : Time - O(1), Space - O(n)
   - Create a char map of opening closing parenthesis.
   - Iterate over the char elements and check stack for following,
     If top most element matches the inversion braces of current char, pop the element from stack
     else add the current element to stack.
   - At the end of iteration, all the char elements should have matched and stack should be empty for valid parenthesis.